+6. The six unnamed vignettes, in the order 44[f], 43[n], 40[f], 41[f], 39[n],
+   38[n] — the first is the ending and the hardest.
+7. The Sønderjysk war dead: the commonly cited range is 5,300–6,200 and the plan
